font-size:12px;\">10</span></b></span>分鐘)；車行至台北車</span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family:&\">站、</span><span style=\"font-family:&\">西門町、新莊夜市、三和夜市、星光夜市(均<span style=\"color:red;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><b>12</b></span></span>分鐘內)，能滿足您的日常需求</span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family:&\">此外，住處鄰近大臺北都會公園，可以讓您在工作繁忙之餘親近綠地</span><br /><br />最後室內空間<span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"><b>不得抽菸</b></span>，也<b><span style=\"color:#ff0000;\">不可養寵物</span></b><br /><br />以上~歡迎各位賞屋參觀!!\r\n附近有便利商店、百貨公司、公園綠地、學校、醫療機構。\r\n本房屋近捷運先嗇宮公車站、五股新莊交流道路、先嗇宮捷運站。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "三重區光復路一段30巷", "lat": "25.046908", "lng": "121.470288", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "bus", "name": "中興北街21號[新巴士]站", "distance": 83, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約83公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "捷運先嗇宮站", "distance": 89, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約89公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "中興街口站", "distance": 192, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約192公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "restaurant", "name": "彼啡食堂", "distance": 53, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約53公尺"}, {"type": "shop", "name": "太平製茶-湯城店", "distance": 288, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約288公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "新北市三重區興穀國民小學", "distance": 564, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約564公尺"}, {"type": "secondary", "name": "新北市立頭前國民中學", "distance": 1425, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約1425公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "11,000元/月", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "車位租金", "value": "費用另計", "key": "carportPrice"}, {"name": "租金含", "value": "管理費、水費、網路、第四台、清潔費", "key": "priceContainText"}]}, "information": {"title": "基礎資料", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "產權登記", "value": "房屋已辦產權登記", "key": "hasCertificate", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "法定用途", "value": "見使照", "key": "purpose", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "可使用面積", "value": "7坪", "key": "area", "alias": "", "cate": 